## 🛠️ Verification & PowerShell Diagnostic Commands

After promotion, execute the following PowerShell commands to ensure directory health and replication readiness:

```powershell
# 1. Verify Domain Controller status
Get-ADDomainController -Filter * | Select-Name, IPv4Address, OperatingSystem

# 2. Check Active Directory Domain details
Get-ADDomain | Select-Object Name, DomainMode, Forest

# 3. Verify DNS Service status
Get-Service -Name DNS

# 4. Run Directory Service Health Diagnostics
dcdiag /v
